g:border-box;float:left\"><div style=\"background-repeat:no-repeat;background-image:-webkit-image-set(url(&quot;https://ci6.googleusercontent.com/proxy/CJz6hH7Y1NoVYS_k_V2Nd0H4deer7Mh8Ni2RoTLpLVU8nAZS101QxLIYU_MPtLVyjuXVXdTh0B7vkF-VFMnljh1C=s0-d-e1-ft#https://ssl.gstatic.com/translate/1x_mobile.png&quot;) 1x,url(&quot;https://ci4.googleusercontent.com/proxy/qedJB26VWcueJkjwpDU4S2COMSo7Rn0892NPRsZAl4FNYmfuLblOp87SHGIlfSbOn5p5S0UGGUG5sC8I5EPxOGvV=s0-d-e1-ft#https://ssl.gstatic.com/translate/2x_mobile.png&quot;) 2x);margin-top:9px;margin-left:12px;background-position:0px 0px\"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(245,245,245);display:flex;min-height:128px;width:640px;border-radius:0px 0px 8px;color:rgb(119,119,119);font-family:Roboto,arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px\"><div><div style=\"min-height:128px;padding:20px 16px 56px 28px;box-sizing:border-box\"><div><div aria-label=\"Destacar traducción\" role=\"button\" style=\"padding:9px;display:inline-block;float:right\"><div style=\"background-repeat:no-repeat;display:inline-block;background-image:-webkit-image-set(url(&quot;https://ci4.googleusercontent.com/proxy/QQuijHNztd0y2axROApU0t1tOHhkQPFEu0ivD4Pg6tHhmEu3rNXaTTcpPcMJ0_ylcetkw2ATKSa45bmp1DBP3_iCPiFO6t8qxzbh3Eo2ofJP0pmp4QXkJS7xi6BQ_Qv2ER05IwOQGCo=s0-d-e1-ft#https://ssl.gstatic.com/images/icons/material/system_gm/1x/star_border_black_24dp.png&quot;) 1x,url(&quot;https://ci6.googleusercontent.com/proxy/HGyZf4qDD3AceJWkzHmkoL2DTIHL5rSMb42j-6Qx5wEwWrKDNIcUV-PNWZUzqHRx2bDs-JjeRsOorkitlE6_KAlBnQFNcrQ2uTM7hXe6rfmL7Y--hQC9aHYdjf_y51i4NgLyv8bqzoQ=s0-d-e1-ft#https://ssl.gstatic.com/images/icons/material/system_gm/2x/star_border_black_24dp.png&quot;) 2x);background-position:center center\"></div></div></div><div style=\"min-height:56px\"><div style=\"padding-right:44px;direction:ltr\"><span lang=\"en\" style=\"min-height:20px;line-height:28px;font-size:18px;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.87);white-space:pre-wrap;padding-right:8px\"><span title=\"\">Good morning</span><br><span title=\"\">Using metadata tagging in digiKam.</span> <span title=\"\">How would it be correct to indicate different species, different behaviors, number of individuals, direction of movement?</span> <span title=\"\">Would it be correct to put all the variables as labels or would I need to indicate a hierarchical order?</span><br><span title=\"\">thank you</span><br><span title=\"\">regards</span></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>"
