ltr\"><span lang=\"en\" style=\"min-height:20px;line-height:28px;font-size:18px;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.87);white-space:pre-wrap;padding-right:8px\"><span title=\"\">Good morning</span><br><span title=\"\">Using metadata tagging in digiKam.</span> <span title=\"\">How would it be correct to indicate different species, different behaviors, number of individuals, direction of movement?</span> <span title=\"\">Would it be correct to put all the variables as labels or would I need to indicate a hierarchical order?</span><br><span title=\"\">thank you</span><br><span title=\"\">regards</span></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>\r\n\r\n<p></p></blockquote></div>"
