   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "\r\n  \r\n    \r\n  \r\n  <div>\r\n    <p>Hi Mari,  <br>\r\n    </p>\r\n    <p>as Lucía said, create separate tag groups for all relevant tags.\r\n      camtrapR won&#39;t read tags properly if there are multiple levels of\r\n      hierarchy.<br>\r\n    </p>\r\n    <p>See vignette 2 for examples. <br>\r\n    </p>\r\n    <p><a href=\"https://jniedballa.github.io/camtrapR/articles/camtrapr2.html#metadata-tagging\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://jniedballa.github.io/camtrapR/articles/camtrapr2.html%23metadata-tagging&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792460585927000&amp;usg=AOvVaw39IuVRr1_zSPutegRBGLay\">https://jniedballa.github.io/camtrapR/articles/camtrapr2.html#metadata-tagging</a></p>\r\n    <p>Here I link the github version because I just discovered a\r\n      critical typo in the vignette in the package which shows the\r\n      intended structure wrongly. In the link above it is fixed. Have a\r\n      look at the little screenshot in particular, that&#39;s what you want.</p>\r\n    <p>Jürgen<br>\r\n    </p></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div>\r\n    <p><br>\r\n    </p>\r\n    <div>Am 26.06.2020 um 20:24 schrieb Lucía\r\n      Rodríguez Planes:<br>\r\n    </div>\r\n    </div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div><blockquote type=\"cite\">\r\n      \r\n      <div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n        <div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Mari! In my experience it&#39;s better to put each\r\n          variable as a different label. That&#39;s because later when\r\n          reading into R those labels, each one becomes a column in a\r\n          data frame. The inner hierarchy of each label becomes the\r\n          different levels on that categorical variable. For example, I\r\n          usually do it this way for the label &quot;number of individuals&quot;\r\n          with an inner hierarchy &quot;1&quot;, &quot;2&quot;, &quot;3&quot;, ... Hope this helps!</div>\r\n        <div dir=\"ltr\"><br>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div>Lucía RP</div>\r\n      </div>\r\n      <br>\r\n      <div class=\"gmail_quote\">\r\n        <div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_attr\">El jue., 25 jun. 2020 a las\r\n          8:48, Mari Piñero Rodríguez (&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">mari....@gmail.com</a>&gt;)\r\n          escribió:<br>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\">\r\n          <div dir=\"ltr\"><br>\r\n            <div>\r\n              <div style=\"display:flex;width:640px;color:rgb(119,119,119);font-family:Roboto,arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px\">\r\n                <div style=\"min-height:114px;vertical-align:top;padding-bottom:56px;border-radius:0px 0px 0px 8px\">\r\n                  <div style=\"min-height:294px\">\r\n                    <div style=\"padding-top:20px;box-sizing:border-box\">\r\n                      <div style=\"min-height:44px\">\r\n                        <div style=\"display:inline-block;float:right;font-size:12px;margin-right:20px;margin-top:12px\">\r\n                          <div>308/5000</div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n                        <div>\r\n                          <div style=\"display:inline-block;min-height:48px;width:48px;flo